States reproduced (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading (skeleton rows while the composed feed resolves with nothing cached), content (the grouped
  result list), empty (web empty-state ternary: noVehicles / scopeEmpty / noResults — friendly message,
  never a blank box), error (QueryError peer: tile + retry), stale + offline (connectivity axis -> freshness
  chip + one-shot auto-refresh on stale). Plus the source's real branches: empty-query landing (Most Used +
  Recent + Pages + Vehicle Commands), live search results + "view all", active scope chip, the vehicle-select
  step for multi-vehicle commands.

